---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Suhan
showRail: true
pagination:
  data: collections.publishedPosts
  size: 5
  alias: pagePosts
eleventyComputed:
  permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/{% else %}/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}"
---

<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Technical notes · essays · interactive works</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">夜里读书，纸上写笔记，偶尔做一点小作品。</h1>
  <p class="hero-copy">这里是 suhan 的个人博客：技术自查表、读书随笔和 {{ customPages.length }} 个手作交互页，全部由 Markdown 或 HTML 在构建期生成。</p>
</section>

<section class="posts-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 class="section-title">Latest</h2>
    <p class="section-note">newest first</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in pagePosts %}
      {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% include "partials/pagination.njk" %}
</section>
